---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/legal-layout.astro';
---
<LegalLayout locale="en" title="Terms of Use" description="Terms for using DoctorConverter's free online document tools: acceptable use, ownership of your files and limitation of liability.">
  <nav aria-label="On this page" class="mb-8 border-y border-border py-4">
    <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-text">On this page</p>
    <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <li>
        <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-accent hover:underline" href="#service">The service</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-accent hover:underline" href="#acceptable-use">Acceptable use</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-accent hover:underline" href="#content">Your content</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-accent hover:underline" href="#liability">Limitation of liability</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-accent hover:underline" href="#changes">Changes</a>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </nav>
  <p>By using DoctorConverter (<strong>doctorconverter.com</strong>) and its document tools you agree to these terms.</p>
  <h2 id="service">1. The service</h2>
  <p>DoctorConverter is a free online tool to convert, compress, merge and edit PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, JPG and PNG files. It is provided “as is”.</p>
  <h2 id="acceptable-use">2. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Use the service lawfully and do not disrupt its infrastructure or other users. You are responsible for the documents you upload and for having the right to process them.</p>
  <h2 id="content">3. Your content</h2>
  <p>You keep all rights to your files. We claim no ownership or license and process files only to perform the job you request.</p>
  <h2 id="liability">4. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>Conversions may not reproduce every document perfectly (for example complex layouts, scanned tables or damaged files). Keep a copy of your originals. DoctorConverter is not liable for losses caused by outages or conversion errors.</p>
  <h2 id="changes">5. Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms; changes take effect when published on this page.</p>
</LegalLayout>
